          "section_id": ".specs/features/008-settings-cli/spec.md:L231-L235",
          "excerpt": "**Criterion:** This feature delivers the shared domain framework (argument parsing, file or `-` (stdin) input, `--dry-run` preview for bulk changes, atomic commit, help text per command) and the output domain for the existing output settings (paste method, clipboard handling, existing auto-submit). The domains microphones, replacements, vocabulary, shortcuts, prompts, destination and the new output settings (smart paste method, automatic Enter) are added on this framework by the features that own them (001–007, 009, 010). `handy settings --help` lists exactly the domains present in the build."
